    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cBell Platinum\u201d also known as \u201cOcean\u2019s Venus\u201d, now shipwreck, used to be a cargo ship built in the 1950s traveling the North Atlantic ocean. As a newly hired maintenance worker aboard, you live through the vessel\u2019s final voyage, uncovering and documenting its dark history. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Complete Tasks </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your work day, you must make sure the ship\u2019s systems are in check and are working as they should. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537860/extras/6f512fcb82c2559e869efd942c3e10c7.poster.avif?t=1753350487\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537860/extras/6f512fcb82c2559e869efd942c3e10c7.webm?t=1753350487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537860/extras/6f512fcb82c2559e869efd942c3e10c7.mp4?t=1753350487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival is Key </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dead worker is a bad worker. If anything or anyone gets in your way, you must always have a careful plan of escape, since there\u2019s not much else you can protect yourself with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537860/extras/24039ad8360cf265b2ed36b34ca311a3.poster.avif?t=1753350487\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537860/extras/24039ad8360cf265b2ed36b34ca311a3.webm?t=1753350487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537860/extras/24039ad8360cf265b2ed36b34ca311a3.mp4?t=1753350487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Certain crucial game mechanics may require close attention to sound - using headphones in a quiet environment is highly recommended!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cBell Platinum\u201d also known as \u201cOcean\u2019s Venus\u201d, now shipwreck, used to be a cargo ship built in the 1950s traveling the North Atlantic ocean. As a newly hired maintenance worker aboard, you live through the vessel\u2019s final voyage, uncovering and documenting its dark history. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Complete Tasks </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your work day, you must make sure the ship\u2019s systems are in check and are working as they should. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537860/extras/6f512fcb82c2559e869efd942c3e10c7.poster.avif?t=1753350487\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537860/extras/6f512fcb82c2559e869efd942c3e10c7.webm?t=1753350487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537860/extras/6f512fcb82c2559e869efd942c3e10c7.mp4?t=1753350487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival is Key </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dead worker is a bad worker. If anything or anyone gets in your way, you must always have a careful plan of escape, since there\u2019s not much else you can protect yourself with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537860/extras/24039ad8360cf265b2ed36b34ca311a3.poster.avif?t=1753350487\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537860/extras/24039ad8360cf265b2ed36b34ca311a3.webm?t=1753350487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass